WEBVTT

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:32.120
Didn't I tell you?

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:34.560
That's my seat.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:38.040
You can't be the Princess.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.020
Who the hell are you?

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.400
Can't you tell by looking at me?

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:57.200
My father is dead, and I have come to take the throne!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.900
I am Princess Alita Forland!

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:07.810
Doctor Akamashi,

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.990
for your treachery, I will take your head!

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.500
Doctor!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.220
What should we do?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.590
Stop that! You foulmouthed princess!

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:23.910
Get your hands away from the doctor right now!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.460
Otherwise Yuna will...

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:27.420
The doctor's gonna get killed,

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.750
killed...

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.450
Gotta save him

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:34.760
Yuna-chan is gonna go berserk.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.020
Weapons from the old world? Mistress, run!

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.000
That bitch!

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.310
That is... the Princess?

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:08.120
Jodo, thank goodness! You're safe!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:08.740
Huh?

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:11.680
I was finally able to come back.

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.880
Jodo, where's Mirano?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.160
Is she safe?

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.560
You are...

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.020
What's wrong, Jodo?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:20.640
It's me, Alita!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.130
Damn it!

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:32.810
They got away.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.200
It doesn't matter.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.840
The recovery of the throne is complete.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.640
Now we can get a huge reward, and something good to eat.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:43.220
If only it were that simple.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.210
What's up?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:48.190
Those guys... how did they get weapons from the old world?

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.440
Mirano...

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.920
I'm sorry, Mirano.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.420
We were too late.

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:11.240
I'm sorry.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:23.860
I'm sorry... Mirano.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.110
Mirano.

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:18.530
Please stay safe, Princess Alita.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:21.600
Why?

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:26.630
Mirano.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.100
Princess, please wake up.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.290
Princess.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.230
What?!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:13.230
Good morning, Princess.

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:17.030
Uh, yeah... Good morning.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.000
It's time to get up, Princess.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.920
Please hurry, Princess.

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.160
The preparations for the coronation are complete.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:28.940
What are you talking about? I'm Faris!

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:30.480
She's the Princess, isn't she?

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:34.340
Princess, what are you saying?

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:41.010
Isn't this my beloved granddaughter, your maid, Mirano Entorasia?

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.720
Well, what the hell...

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.570
My name is Mirano.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.830
Princess, if you have woken up, the first thing you must do is...

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:49.710
That's enough!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:00.610
W-w-w-w-w-what is the meaning of this appearance?!

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.430
Is there something wrong with being naked?

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:03.450
It's vulgar!
Is there something wrong with being naked?

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.560
It's vulgar!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.540
It can't be helped!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.200
Yesterday's clothes are covered in blood!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.130
You're a very stubborn princess.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.620
That's why I said I'm not the Princess!

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.720
How is the temperature?

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.780
That feels great.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:32.290
Being a princess is really wonderful.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:38.320
Hey, by the way. Why am I the successor to the throne?

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:45.660
In our country, when the King dies the next ruler must be chosen within a week.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:49.620
This time, there are only two candidates for the throne,

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.020
Prince Kaito, and his little sister, Princess Alita.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.430
So why not the Prince?

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:59.450
My brother Kaito is serving abroad with the military.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.870
We can't contact him, and we don't know when he will return.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.030
That's why the Princess will be...

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.850
You're the Princess, aren't you?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.870
No one would realize I'm the Princess with this appearance.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:15.270
I don't care. I've fulfilled our promise.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.500
Once I've got the reward, I don't care about this place anymore.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.340
The promise hasn't been fulfilled yet.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:26.140
My wish was for you to save this country.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:27.800
I've saved it, haven't I?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.290
No. The ones who tried to destroy this country have not given up.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:37.570
If they come back, Forland has nothing to oppose them with.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:43.300
Until my brother returns, this country needs a strong ruler.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:48.050
Please! You have to protect this country!

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:54.850
This country that she gave her life for... this country...

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.880
So that's why I have to defend the throne?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.450
You're sure making it hard on me.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:04.280
Didn't you accept that for the reward?

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:09.250
You will have... me...

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.180
my...

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.520
everything....

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.350
Not there!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.990
So, it's a promise.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.670
Please protect us!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:45.190
Why... so... what?

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.000
Let's do it!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.450
THAT HURTS!!!!!!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:54.020
Why are your clothes this tight!?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:58.410
A lady's clothes have to fit her body perfectly!

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.360
What's up? Not eating?

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.820
The corset's too tight, so I don't have an appetite.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.160
At least eat a little.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:14.540
Yeah.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.170
That is not the proper way to pick up a knife and fork!

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.170
Whatever; any way is fine!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.530
It won't do.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:29.960
In order to protect the throne, in your role as royalty, you must learn proper manners!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:31.550
Princess.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:34.160
Seriously?

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:36.140
Yes!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.000
First off, how to pick them up!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.030
Ah, that's completely wrong!

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.560
You old piece of shit!

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:00.910
Welcome back Ana-chan.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.130
I'm back!

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:07.030
Doctor, I've got a map of the coronation parade's route.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.790
The Princess will certainly be at the head of the parade.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.840
Last time was a failure, but this time...

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:19.010
This time, the Princess will be in our hands!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.040
And after that, that thing...

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.830
If we get hold of it, the doctor's ambitions will be...

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.340
Ahhh, I'm tired.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.690
You've been trying so hard to learn all this.

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:51.740
Well, I did promise her.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.640
There's no obligation to keep that kind of promise, you know.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.350
I know...

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:03.330
Princess, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.420
What is it?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.500
You mustn't take the corset off!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.200
It's really painful!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:19.400
You mustn't take it off until after tomorrow's coronation.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:22.000
Oh no, you can't be serious!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.390
So the Princess is going to take the throne?

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.020
I think it's only until Prince Kaito returns.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:36.760
Thus, in the name of God, the Forland Andelnia Dynasty,

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:40.250
and the daughter of the late Emperor of Mitto Gardens kingdoms,

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:44.790
the leader of the Northern Orshia Alliance will now be crowned.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:51.780
The 12th generation of the Andelnia Dynasty, Alita Castillia Arago Forland.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:00.930
Princess, are you really ok with this?

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.630
I'm not the Princess anymore.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.960
But...

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:08.780
That night, in the dark Ellend Forest,

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.920
the title of Princess, the name Alita,

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:19.820
my body, and everything I have, I gave to Mistress Faris.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:25.830
In return for that, she saved this country.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:31.190
Now, I'm a servant to the Forland royal family,

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:33.630
Jodo Entorasia's granddaughter,

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:37.180
and the Princess' maid: Mirano Entorasia.

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:39.860
Princess...

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.150
Should I?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.010
Sure, go for it.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.090
Yeah.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:58.920
Yay!

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.170
Woohoo!

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:04.160
I'm da Princess!

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.990
This really is like a festival!

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:29.600
Forland is a small kingdom, so the royal family is close to the people.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:35.830
This coronation parade is to celebrate with the people.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.030
They're what's important to this country, huh?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.260
Princeeesssss!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.890
In that case, please take me as the reward.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:05.080
To protect my country, I don't care what I have to do.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.310
Is this what you want to protect?

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:13.170
Nothing.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.170
This is a nice country, isn't it?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.220
Yes!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.970
This is the last time you're gonna be able to look that happy!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:32.720
Yuna-chan, start the operation to capture Princess Alita!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:33.420
Ok.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.720
Go! The result of the doctor's darkest research is...

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:41.970
Synthetic Giant Monster!

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.280
Go catch Princess Alita!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.140
What's that?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.520
What's happening?

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.060
That's...

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.710
It's gigantic.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:01.380
A hybrid giant, huh? It must be them again.

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.220
I expect it's after me.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.720
You're certainly a popular princess.

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:07.800
Shut up.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.290
Mirano, get the people out of here.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:11.760
Yes!

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.440
Come on, then!

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:20.940
Damn it.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:23.010
That's what you mean by, "Come on, then?"

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.340
I just let my guard down a little.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.660
Right, I'll let you take care of him.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:27.910
Huh?

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:31.220
It must be commanded by Onion-head and the brats.

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:32.500
I'll deal with them.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.340
Fine then. Leave this to me.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:39.250
Come on then! Queen Alita Forland is your opponent!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.370
If things carry on like this, it'll get broken!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.730
Yuna-chan, fire it into him.

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.750
Ok.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.020
The Mistress is...

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:26.040
It's being damaged! There must be something else we can do.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.450
Use the rest of the medicine.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.340
It's time to stop playing around.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:32.660
Just as I expected.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.710
Damn it. They escaped.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:49.550
Amazing.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:55.950
Mistress...

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.170
What on earth...

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:04.760
You mustn't!

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:11.470
Mistress!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.530
Princess.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.300
It's alright.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.130
Mirano, I...

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:44.270
What the hell?

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.210
I...

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.410
Thank goodness.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.760
The Princess protected us!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:12.060
Long live the Princess! Long live the Princess!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:37.280
During today's incident, the Princess has gained the people's absolute trust.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:41.100
If that's the case, why are you looking so depressed, Pops?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.230
At the end of today's battle,

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:50.150
for a moment, the Princess was on the verge of killing both Mirano and the citizen.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.170
Could that be...

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.300
The Mistress' real personality? You're wrong.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:21:00.290
The Mistress would never kill children.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:03.320
There must have been some other reason.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.880
What would that be?

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.820
Good question. I have no idea.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:11.690
By the way, there are some things I'd like to know.

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:13.770
Like what?

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:18.410
Firstly, where did Onion-head's powers come from?

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:22.700
And what are they aiming for?

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.170
Well, I'm sure they'll come again.

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.640
I can put this on myself, you know.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:42.180
No, you have to get used to this soon.

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.660
That sort of thing, huh?

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.990
The people are very pleased.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:51.190
They can relax now that they have a strong princess.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:54.810
Strong, huh?

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:57.150
Never mind.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:04.580
Princess, please protect this country, won't you?

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:07.590
It's a promise!

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.800
Yeah... sure.

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:16.820
Please do!

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:32.120
But you are the one who is truly strong, Mirano.
